# Quick requests for the demo. Works in Visual Studio, VS Code (REST Client) and Rider.
# Switch @host between local and the deployed app to show the same requests hitting both.

@host = http://localhost:5292
# @host = https://app-devops-demo-dev-xxxxx.azurewebsites.net

### What is running right now? Version and commit come from the artifact,
### environment and message come from App Service configuration.
GET {{host}}/api/info
Accept: application/json

### Greeting, Norwegian (the default)
GET {{host}}/api/greet/Martin
Accept: application/json

### Greeting, English
GET {{host}}/api/greet/Tobias?language=en
Accept: application/json

### Rejected: unsupported language -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/greet/Martin?language=fr
Accept: application/json

### Rejected: name too long -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/greet/aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
Accept: application/json

### The six principles from the lecture
GET {{host}}/api/principles
Accept: application/json

### Health, used by the deploy smoke test and the keep-warm schedule
GET {{host}}/health
